      "SurveyID": "SV_MindsInMotionConsent",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID17",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "<h4>How you would like to be compensated</h4><p>We use these details only to pay you for taking part",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<h4>How you would like to be compensated</h4><p>We use these details only to pay you for taking part. They are held separately from your research data, are never used for any other purpose, and are deleted once your payment has cleared. They are not part of the research record and are not retained with it.</p>",
